Lemma keep_k4 : forall W m m' s LB rdi rdi' XS, Forall (wg4 H X) W -> munch W m m' -> wmono bsegs m m' -> as_RHEAP H s (LB ++ LB0) m ->
  bp_frameF H X m' -> rw_cells bsegs m' (P + 240) [C1 rdi'] ->
  inv_k H X m rdi XS -> inv_k H X m' rdi' XS.
Proof.
  intros W m m' s LB rdi rdi' XS FW MU WM RH FRF' RDI' ([errv ERR] & AUX & FR4 & FRF & SD & RDI & FTS & FSX & INX & XP).
  pose proof (wg4_wg7 H HH MX CX X XOK W FW) as FW7. pose proof (wg4_wg H HH MX CX X XOK W FW) as FWg.
  split; [exists errv; exact (keep_errno H HH MX CX X XOK _ _ _ _ FWg MU WM ERR)|].
  split; [exact (keep_rauxv H HH MX CX X XOK _ _ _ _ _ _ FWg MU WM RH AUX)|].
  split; [exact (keep_frame4 H HH MX CX X XOK W m m' FW MU WM FR4)|]. split; [exact FRF'|].
  split; [exact (keep_side H HH MX CX X XOK _ _ _ _ FW7 MU WM (frameF_row H X _ FRF') eq_refl SD)|].
  split; [exact RDI'|]. split; [exact (keep_ft H HH MX CX X XOK _ _ _ FWg MU WM FTS)|]. split; [exact FSX|]. split; [exact INX|].
  exact (keep_xpres H HH MX CX X XOK _ _ _ _ FWg MU WM INX XP).
Qed.

